              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, abantu badlula, babona isiyelo endleleni, nengonyama imi ngasesitingweni; bafika babika emzini lapho umprofethi omdala ayehlala khona.",
          "type": "text",
