          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umprofethi wasiphakamisa isidumbu somuntu kaNkulunkulu, wasibeka embongolweni, wasibuyisa; umprofethi omdala wangena emzini ukumlilela nokummbela.",
          "type": "text",
